@startuml put-manager-company-pk-logo
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title PUT /api/manager/v1/company/{pk}/logo
caption CRB-68 · 업로드한 로고를 확정하고 회사에 연결 (이전 로고 대체)

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "AdminCompanyController" as Controller
participant "AdminCompanyService" as Service
participant "FileService" as FileService
participant "AdminCompanyRepository" as AdminCompanyRepository
database PostgreSQL
participant "S3"

Client -> Guard: PUT /api/manager/v1/company/{pk}/logo\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>\n{ key }
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt pk 가 양의 정수가 아님, key 빈 문자열
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: updateLogo(pk, req, manager)
Controller -> Service: updateLogo(pk, key, manager.pk)

Service -> FileService: confirmUpload(manager.pk, "company_logo", key)
note right of FileService
  트랜잭션 밖에서 먼저 (DB 잠금을 오래 잡지 않음) — flow/file-upload.puml
  key 가 tmp/company-logo/<adminAccountPk>/ 아래가 아니면 400 Invalid file key
  S3 에 없으면 400 File not found
  파일 앞부분으로 형식 재확인, 다르면 tmp 삭제 후 400 Unsupported file type
end note
FileService -> S3: HeadObject / GetObject(Range) / CopyObject → company-logo/<uuid>.<ext> / DeleteObject(tmp)
FileService --> Service: 확정 key
alt confirmUpload 실패
  FileService -[#red]-> Client: 400 Invalid file key / File not found / Unsupported file type
end

group transaction (DatabaseService.db.transaction)
  Service -> AdminCompanyRepository: findByPkForUpdate(pk, tx)
  AdminCompanyRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT company_alias WHERE pk = ? FOR UPDATE
  note right: 병합 · 삭제 · 동시 로고 변경과 직렬화
  PostgreSQL --> AdminCompanyRepository: row | 없음
  alt 회사 없음 (병합 · 삭제됨)
    Service -[#red]-> Client: 404 Company not found
  end
  note right of Service
    확정한 새 파일은 지우지 않음 (커밋 직후 연결이 끊긴 경우 대비).
    참조 없는 파일은 OrphanFileService 가 정리
  end note
  Service -> AdminCompanyRepository: updateLogo(pk, key, tx)
  AdminCompanyRepository -> PostgreSQL: UPDATE company_alias SET logo_key = ?, updated_at = now()
end
note over Service, PostgreSQL: 트랜잭션 안의 예외는 전부 rollback 후 응답

opt 이전 로고가 있었음
  Service -> FileService: deleteFileQuietly(previousKey)
  FileService -> S3: DeleteObject
  note right: 커밋 뒤에 지움. 실패하면 로그만
end

Service --> Controller: BaseResultDto.OK
Controller --> Client: 200 { result: "OK" }
note right of Client
  OrphanFileService(flow/s3-orphan-cleanup.puml) 에 company-logo/ 디렉터리 추가:
  company_alias.logo_key 가 참조하지 않는 파일 정리
end note

@enduml
